comment = "DescriptorQueue controller library (libdq)"

desc = <<EOD
libdq, the userland controller library for the dq(4) DescriptorQueue
device.  A controller opens a queue, mints file descriptors that present an
identity of its choosing, reads the operations the kernel turns into events
on them, and answers them.  The library also connects to the dq.observe
capability service to list queues and objects and to subscribe to a queue's
observer stream.
EOD
